i.MX/S32/LS1/LS2 I2C Driver

%C [options]

Options:
-c clock        Input clock (Default: 66500000)
-i irq          Interrupt number (Default: -1)
-l              Need _NTO_TCTL_IO_PRIV
-p physbase     I2C controller physical base address (Default: 0)
-s slave_addr   I2C slave address (Default: 0)
-t itype        I2C controller type. 0: i.MX, 1: S32/LS1/LS2 (Default: 0)
-v              Increase verbose (Default: 2)

Generic options for I2C resource manager libi2c-master:
--b bus_speed   Default bus speed. (Default: 100000)
--u unit        Unit number. Number to append to device name
                prefix (/dev/i2c). (Default: 0)
